From 5e79cfc85e499d034e21c511b5847e09c9627ba2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LGNative <luis@nativestride.io>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 20:51:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Theme: extend brand scale to all remaining palettes +
 softer paper bg

Replace every remaining hand-picked colour with theme tokens derived from
the generated --brand-* scale:
- net-worth category colours, allocation-target palette, rebalance drift,
  donut/target-rails, preset picker, alt-asset badges: olive/sand/clay
  hexes -> --chart-*/--primary/--destructive/--chart-stone.
- retirement-planner + save-up: self-contained olive/amber/red palette ->
  --primary/--success/--warning/--destructive; neutral ramp now mixes
  foreground into card so it tracks light AND dark.

Light surface: --flexoki-bg 97%->94% (soft warm paper #F5F2EA), cards
recede a touch. Remove the metallic gradient washes on the value-strip
hero (flat, editorial). Chart ramp starts at the brand green (chart-1)
instead of a near-white/near-black extreme. Breakdown delta column grows
to max-content so extreme percentages stop overflowing the card.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
